* Diodes Inc. 1N4148WT coefficients; wrapper exposes A K for KiCad.
* Source: https://www.diodes.com/spice/download/1492/1N4148WT.spice.txt
* The bare non-SPICE word 'Switching' in the downloaded source is omitted.
.SUBCKT D_1N4148WT A K
D_CORE A K DI_1N4148WT
.MODEL DI_1N4148WT D (IS=10.4n RS=51.5m BV=80 IBV=1u
+ CJO=2p M=0.333 N=2.07 TT=5.76n)
.ENDS D_1N4148WT
